{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeble Origins is a small <strong>adventure</strong> with a <strong>retro</strong> tone that puts the spotlight on the <strong>melee</strong> class of <strong>adventurer</strong> and trades away the complexity of modern gaming for a <strong>classic</strong> feel. Instead of experience points and sprawling skill trees, your progression comes from <strong>meaningful</strong> <strong>gear</strong> upgrades, the <strong>story</strong> you uncover, and the world itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Begin Your Feeble Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your travels have led you to Makestone, a quiet village perched on ruins so old only the Giants can pronounce them. Adventurers have chased its rumors for generations, and the few who return don\u2019t offer much in the way of details. The abandoned loot they left behind is what brought you here in the first place. Now that you\u2019ve arrived, it\u2019s up to you to discover what <i>lies</i> beneath Makestone Village\u2026and pick up whatever you can carry out along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.poster.avif?t=1770487377\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.webm?t=1770487377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.mp4?t=1770487377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore at Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Feeble Origins is <strong>non-linear</strong>\u00a0and becomes more <strong>open</strong> the more you progress, letting you choose your path with each quest. Venture further into the woods, <strong>descend</strong> into <strong>crypts</strong>, or brave the <strong>caverns</strong>. Each location holds its own <strong>secrets</strong>, <strong>puzzles</strong>, and fragments of a <strong>deeper story</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meaningful Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new <strong>weapon</strong> or <strong>armor</strong> piece is a <strong>meaningful upgrade</strong>, with each <strong>choice</strong> making a difference in gameplay style. Combat is straightforward but <strong>viscerally satisfying</strong>, with each swing, block, and <strong>dodge</strong> feeling earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.poster.avif?t=1770487377\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.webm?t=1770487377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.mp4?t=1770487377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each <strong>quest</strong>, you'll uncover pieces of a growing <strong>mystery</strong>: Why are the <strong>dead rising</strong>? Who is behind it? And what <i>lies</i> <strong>beneath</strong> Makestone Village?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nostalgia, Reimagined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeble Origins is built to evoke the warmth of <strong>retro</strong> RPGs--not through pixel-perfect imitation--but through <strong>tone</strong>, pacing, and <strong>simplicity</strong>. It's a game that respects your time, <strong>rewards</strong> your curiosity, and invites you to settle into its rhythm.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/8efd3b7ce06f796cca067e12d2738de4cf522832.jpg"},{"name":"Slay The Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/030e0eca8521ab819102dc991cae3ef0a06e78a6.jpg"},{"name":"Match Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/9504bff4d11552e361ef575ac510b1222e4dc42a.jpg"},{"name":"Mining Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/6df0f52c303dc3382a2adb61c4d04a7f917e74f9.jpg"},{"name":"Underworld","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/417b3b6e9a1fc32d1a7ba37ce28bc37ce916635a.jpg"},{"name":"A Humongous Problem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/f63d3254f1d8ac5b88f9cef617a148a0f993de34.jpg"},{"name":"What Is Dead Can Die Actually","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/eff432a542cd55cad43b18e07f788d167c07f38d.jpg"},{"name":"Missing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/bfe26540f9be8f61181ebb37291eadb717246c3b.jpg"},{"name":"Bulwark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/f2ff1a76b03774bd6e0e5fba9c91f36fc8f002a9.jpg"},{"name":"Lost In Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/345020/c4898a56535d5bd3f29007bd1b4403988890f3e3.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/345020?t=1770487377","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/c066d942f77ca26ce94eda8cfcda018dddacefb2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770487377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/b20d4a5b5af32e1899423f8f5ec5ee4c8b407920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770487377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/b20d4a5b5af32e1899423f8f5ec5ee4c8b407920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770487377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4366090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeble Origins is a small <strong>adventure</strong> with a <strong>retro</strong> tone that puts the spotlight on the <strong>melee</strong> class of <strong>adventurer</strong> and trades away the complexity of modern gaming for a <strong>classic</strong> feel. Instead of experience points and sprawling skill trees, your progression comes from <strong>meaningful</strong> <strong>gear</strong> upgrades, the <strong>story</strong> you uncover, and the world itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Begin Your Feeble Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your travels have led you to Makestone, a quiet village perched on ruins so old only the Giants can pronounce them. Adventurers have chased its rumors for generations, and the few who return don\u2019t offer much in the way of details. The abandoned loot they left behind is what brought you here in the first place. Now that you\u2019ve arrived, it\u2019s up to you to discover what <i>lies</i> beneath Makestone Village\u2026and pick up whatever you can carry out along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.poster.avif?t=1770487377\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.webm?t=1770487377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/6a6111041ef08a80b7d778ac3b8f41a4.mp4?t=1770487377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore at Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Feeble Origins is <strong>non-linear</strong>\u00a0and becomes more <strong>open</strong> the more you progress, letting you choose your path with each quest. Venture further into the woods, <strong>descend</strong> into <strong>crypts</strong>, or brave the <strong>caverns</strong>. Each location holds its own <strong>secrets</strong>, <strong>puzzles</strong>, and fragments of a <strong>deeper story</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meaningful Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new <strong>weapon</strong> or <strong>armor</strong> piece is a <strong>meaningful upgrade</strong>, with each <strong>choice</strong> making a difference in gameplay style. Combat is straightforward but <strong>viscerally satisfying</strong>, with each swing, block, and <strong>dodge</strong> feeling earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.poster.avif?t=1770487377\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.webm?t=1770487377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/extras/d1d77c517ac39a300f1c30a34901212a.mp4?t=1770487377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each <strong>quest</strong>, you'll uncover pieces of a growing <strong>mystery</strong>: Why are the <strong>dead rising</strong>? Who is behind it? And what <i>lies</i> <strong>beneath</strong> Makestone Village?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nostalgia, Reimagined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeble Origins is built to evoke the warmth of <strong>retro</strong> RPGs--not through pixel-perfect imitation--but through <strong>tone</strong>, pacing, and <strong>simplicity</strong>. It's a game that respects your time, <strong>rewards</strong> your curiosity, and invites you to settle into its rhythm.</p>","developers":["Wasatch Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/345020/bc743139035e0b7b36dfcda114d12ed3323f0c80/header.jpg?t=1770487377","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5\u20112500 / AMD FX\u20116300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 950 / RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Steam Deck Supported</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2015+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.11+<br